    "text": "If&nbsp;<math><mi>f</mi><mo>:</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1,1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> be a function defined as&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mtext>sin</mtext><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced><mtext>,</mtext></math>&nbsp;then <math><mi>f</mi></math> is"
